# .env holds secrets (ntfy topic, DB connection string, API key, contact info) and must never enter an image layer.
# **/ so a .env anywhere in the tree is excluded, not just at the root.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

**/bin
**/obj
.git
.github
.claude
.vs
.vscode
.idea
tests
tools
deploy
# The dev database definition (carries a dev-only password) has no place in the image.
docker-compose*.yml
*.md
